The files in this directory come from the Plivo Go SDK,
https://github.com/plivo/plivo-go, used under the license below: the
*Response.json files are its fixtures/, and requests.json lists the requests
its source (v7.61.0) builds, as tools/sdkparams writes them.
Changes to the fixtures: lists are cut to a few entries that hold every
field, and account IDs, tokens, passwords, emails, phone numbers (to
555-01xx), hosts, IP addresses, personal names, a brand alias, the campaign
list's next link and a callback URL are replaced with example values.

